    "updated_at": "2022-04-10T11:57:32Z",
    "body": "I was ssh'd in indeed because the new laptop was hooked up to all my displays and I tucked it away in clamshell mode for some manual migrations as needed. Prompt looks as I expect it in an iTerm window on it directly.\r\n\r\nThis is all starting to make sense now. The new laptop didn't have a ~/.aws/config file yet (although ~/.aws/credentials existed), so it didn't need the aws prompt hidden explicitly.\r\n\r\nThanks again for the quick help. This clarifies everything :)",
